#. [component.Widget.percentageOfDaysWithServiceInterruptionDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of "device-days" that were statused as "down for repair", excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices would equate 100 "device-days". If one device was down half of the month, this number would be 10%
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The percentage of \"device-days\" that were statused as \"down for repair\", "
"excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices "
"would equate 100 \"device-days\". If one device was down half of the month, "
"this number would be 10%"
msgstr ""
"A porcentagem de \"dias de dispositivo\" que foram classificados como "
"\"inativos para reparo\", excluindo fins de semana. Por exemplo, 20 dias da "
"semana no mês e 5 dispositivos equivalem a 100 \"dias do dispositivo\". Se "
"um dispositivo caísse na metade do mês, esse número seria de 10%"

